      "message": "feat(sync): trust-server flag and trusted-domains config\n\nMerges pr/sync-trust-server-flag\n\n- detect git servers that are fast-forward ahead of nostr state\n- `ngit sync --trust-server` (-t) to adopt those commits and update nostr state\n- `nostr.trust-server-domains` git config to auto-trust servers by domain\n- diverged-branch detection with recovery instructions\n- skip pushing back to servers that are already ahead\n\ncloses nostr:nevent1qvzqqqqx2ypzpgqgmmc409hm4xsdd74sf68a2uyf9pwel4g9mfdg8l5244t6x4jdqy88wumn8ghj7mn0wvhxcmmv9uq3xamnwvaz7tm8d96xummnw3ezucm0d5hsqgyrag0kt9hsgaclkc583jyh6xnr7u77rg06mrsacy4zdvgzk2vqegpvfapw\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tCHANGELOG.md",
