      "message": "feat(sync): add nostr.trust-server-domains git config setting\n\nServers whose hostname appears in the semicolon-separated\nnostr.trust-server-domains list are automatically trusted during\nngit sync without requiring --trust-server.  Can be set globally\nor per-repository:\n\n  git config --global nostr.trust-server-domains 'github.com;codeberg.org'\n\nWhen untrusted-ahead refs remain after auto-trust processing, the\nexisting --trust-server hint is shown; a secondary tip pointing to\nthe new config key is added when the list is currently empty.",
