      "message": "fix: bail on submodule entries in create_commit_from_patch\n\nlibgit2's apply_to_tree does not handle submodule entries (mode 160000)\ngracefully — instead of returning an error it dereferences a null pointer\nand kills the git-remote-nostr process with signal 11 (SIGSEGV).\n\nDetect submodule entries in the normalised diff content before calling into\nlibgit2 and return an Err so make_commits_for_proposal can skip the\nproposal cleanly rather than crashing the remote helper.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "6eb08e3b60f752a1dabfd9b126dd7e7d385dca55",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/DanConwayDev/ngit-cli/git/trees/6eb08e3b60f752a1dabfd9b126dd7e7d385dca55"
