      "message": "fix: ff push to pr/ branch backed by PR event fails\n\nPR and PR-update events (kinds 1618/1619) store the tip commit in a\n\"c\" tag rather than a \"commit\" tag. get_commit_id_from_patch only\nchecked \"commit\" and the mbox From-line heuristic, so a non-force push\nto a pr/ branch whose latest nostr event was a PR kind would bail with\n\"event is not a patch\" even though the push was a valid fast-forward.\n\nFix by checking the \"c\" tag for PR/PR-update events. Add unit tests for\nall three cases (patch, PR, PR-update).",
